# Walkthrough - Advanced Machine Learning (Phase 6)

I have successfully implemented the most advanced features of the predictive maintenance system: **Explainable AI (XAI)** and the **Automated PDCA Retraining** loop.

## Key Enhancements

### 1. Explainable AI (XAI) with SHAP
Technicians no longer have to guess "why" the AI is predicting a failure. Each prediction now includes specific **Risk Factors** (SHAP values).
- **Transparency**: Shows which sensor (Torque, Temperature, Tool Wear) contributed most to the risk.
- **Improved Decision Making**: Technicians can focus their inspection on the specific component identified by the AI.

### 2. Automated PDCA Retraining Pipeline
We have closed the loop between reality and intelligence:
- **PLAN**: AI predicts failure (Multi-model P1-P6).
- **DO**: Technician performs the intervention.
- **CHECK**: Technician closes the intervention and provides **Ground Truth** feedback (Actual failure type + AI Match).
- **ACT**: Administrators can trigger **Automated Retraining** from the new ML Dashboard, which refits the XGBoost model using this new feedback correlated with sensor snapshots.

### 3. ML Admin Dashboard
A new control center for administrators:
- **Accuracy Monitoring**: Monitor the collection of "Ground Truth" data points.
- **One-Click Retraining**: Automate the refit of the failure prediction models.
- **Model Versioning**: Automatic backups of older models ensure safety and roll-back capability.

## Technical Details

- **Backend**:
    - [XAIService](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Downloads/EAM/EAMSagemCom/app/backend/modules/ml/services/ml_xai.py#9-79): Leverages the `shap` library for feature-level explanation.
    - [RetrainingService](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Downloads/EAM/EAMSagemCom/app/backend/modules/ml/services/ml_retraining.py#19-134): Correlates [MlPredictionLog](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Downloads/EAM/EAMSagemCom/app/backend/models/ml_prediction_log.py#6-48) snapshots with [Ordres_intervention](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Downloads/EAM/EAMSagemCom/app/backend/models/ordres_intervention.py#6-34) feedback to generate new training sets for `XGBoost`.
    - [MlPredictionLog](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Downloads/EAM/EAMSagemCom/app/backend/models/ml_prediction_log.py#6-48): Now captures full sensor telemetry at prediction time for future retraining.
- **Frontend**:
    - [MLDashboard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Downloads/EAM/EAMSagemCom/app/frontend/src/modules/admin/ml/MLDashboard.tsx): New monitoring and control interface for AI.
    - [PredictivePanel.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Downloads/EAM/EAMSagemCom/app/frontend/src/modules/shared/machines/components/PredictivePanel.tsx): Updated with real-time SHAP risk factors.
    - [FinishInterventionDialog.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Downloads/EAM/EAMSagemCom/app/frontend/src/modules/technicien/components/FinishInterventionDialog.tsx): Enhanced to capture explicit AI match feedback.
    - [PDCACanbanBoard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Downloads/EAM/EAMSagemCom/app/frontend/src/modules/shared/machines/components/PDCACanbanBoard.tsx): Now links the 'ACT' phase to the retraining control center.

